      "content": "SP 8607               WENDOVER               HIGH STREET                                              south side 10/250                                       No.11 Lloyds Bank GV                                           II Bank, formerly a house. C18, painted stucco, old tile roof, brick stack to LH, 2 storeys, 3 bays of barred sash windows, 4-panes wide in outer bays, 2 panes in centre. Ground floor has flanking 3-light sashes and central 6-panel door in wood surround with reeded pilasters, frieze panelled with diamond motif, carved scroll brackets and flat hood. Listing NGR: SP8686707826"
    }
